    "CoiStatement": "All LFCs (i.e. intervention wheelchair) were donated for the project, and the company, GRIT, was not included in any part of the research design, data collection and/or analysis. None of the authors received any compensation from GRIT.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": 342},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
        "UI": "D016428",
